{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"2e4a8dc9a8806e88cad6029cbd4cd0fef83e0076d74bcd860867eeefd76d1c59"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:701465f61cc94b23111f61631e017b9adfabdd7c42e789c47b08becd1c94a60a","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Various outdoor and community activities together","evidence":"[D25:2 | 6:21 pm on 22 July, 2023] Maria: Hey John, glad work is going well! Having a good team is so important. I had a great experience last weekend hiking with my church  friends - it was great to be surrounded by supportive people and to enjoy nature. Felt so refreshing!\n[D24:6 | 3:34 pm on 17 July, 2023] Maria: Yeah, last weekend I had a picnic with some friends from church. We chilled under the trees, played games, and ate yummy food. It was great!\n[D28:5 | 5:19 pm on 5 August, 2023] John: Thanks Maria! I may have found a job at a tech company I like that needs my mechanical skills for their hardware team. It feels different, but I think it's a great opportunity to learn and contribute.","itemId":"urn:uuid:b000a9e6-4c24-53ad-8fc5-523c47cfe63a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:3e90780531d0647e78eca5ed86d53cd71b86fae24242f42e93439e4f62e6732e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What activities has Maria done with her church friends?","referenceAnswer":"Hiking, picnic, volunteer work","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"3e90780531d0647e78eca5ed86d53cd71b86fae24242f42e93439e4f62e6732e"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}